[
  {
    "text": "PIREEL / 开源视频编辑研究 · 016",
    "x": 102,
    "baseline": 79,
    "width": 388.49,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "能剪素材，也能做动态图文。",
    "x": 98,
    "baseline": 159,
    "width": 884.0,
    "size": 68
  },
  {
    "text": "把我们的理解连成一条线：输入 → 决策 → 编辑 → 合成 → 成片 → 使用价值",
    "x": 102,
    "baseline": 212,
    "width": 996.1,
    "size": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "基于源码与本机实测",
    "x": 1830.0,
    "baseline": 90,
    "width": 198.0,
    "size": 22
  },
  {
    "text": "Pireel Studio",
    "x": 1892.23,
    "baseline": 160,
    "width": 195.77,
    "size": 31
  },
  {
    "text": "开源版本 b824ee2",
    "x": 1897.25,
    "baseline": 205,
    "width": 190.75,
    "size": 23
  },
  {
    "text": "核心定位：可由人或 AI 操作的视频编辑与动态图文合成系统。",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 295,
    "width": 959.68,
    "size": 35
  },
  {
    "text": "AI 或人决定表达与取舍；编辑程序负责执行、计算画面、处理声音并导出。",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 333,
    "width": 932.21,
    "size": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "01",
    "x": 72,
    "baseline": 419,
    "width": 51.81,
    "size": 42
  },
  {
    "text": "给它什么素材，可以得到什么效果？",
    "x": 151,
    "baseline": 417,
    "width": 608.0,
    "size": 38
  },
  {
    "text": "不限于已有视频，也可从图片、文字和图形开始",
    "x": 1584.0,
    "baseline": 417,
    "width": 504.0,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "输入素材",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 495,
    "width": 101.33,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "编辑与合成操作",
    "x": 688,
    "baseline": 495,
    "width": 177.33,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "对应效果",
    "x": 1512,
    "baseline": 495,
    "width": 101.33,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "视频 / 录屏 / 口播",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 567,
    "width": 238.69,
    "size": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "截取、分割、排序、调整画面取景",
    "x": 688,
    "baseline": 567,
    "width": 420.0,
    "size": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "讲解精剪、产品演示、片段集锦",
    "x": 1512,
    "baseline": 567,
    "width": 373.33,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "图片 / 照片 / 截图",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 632,
    "width": 238.69,
    "size": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "设置时长、移动缩放、与其他内容叠加",
    "x": 688,
    "baseline": 632,
    "width": 476.0,
    "size": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "图文短片、截图讲解、展示画面",
    "x": 1512,
    "baseline": 632,
    "width": 373.33,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "现成配音 / 背景音乐",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 697,
    "width": 266.01,
    "size": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "按时间对齐、调音量、淡入淡出与混音",
    "x": 688,
    "baseline": 697,
    "width": 476.0,
    "size": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "旁白配画面、背景音乐",
    "x": 1512,
    "baseline": 697,
    "width": 266.67,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "文字 / 已有字幕",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 762,
    "width": 207.34,
    "size": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "排版、定时显示、设置动态入场效果",
    "x": 688,
    "baseline": 762,
    "width": 448.0,
    "size": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "动态标题、字幕、重点提示",
    "x": 1512,
    "baseline": 762,
    "width": 320.0,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "数字 / 图表 / 步骤数据",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 827,
    "width": 297.35,
    "size": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "配置图形组件，由动画时间线驱动",
    "x": 688,
    "baseline": 827,
    "width": 420.0,
    "size": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "动态数字、图表、步骤卡片",
    "x": 1512,
    "baseline": 827,
    "width": 320.0,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "提示：自动转写、文字生成配音属于额外服务；已有字幕、配音和音乐可作为素材使用。",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 879,
    "width": 936.0,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "02",
    "x": 72,
    "baseline": 963,
    "width": 51.81,
    "size": 42
  },
  {
    "text": "谁做决定？谁真正制作视频？",
    "x": 151,
    "baseline": 961,
    "width": 494.0,
    "size": 38
  },
  {
    "text": "谁来决定怎么剪？",
    "x": 98,
    "baseline": 1048,
    "width": 240.0,
    "size": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "Pireel：保存并执行编辑安排",
    "x": 746,
    "baseline": 1048,
    "width": 384.96,
    "size": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "最后得到什么？",
    "x": 1554,
    "baseline": 1048,
    "width": 210.0,
    "size": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "人：在画布与时间线上直接操作",
    "x": 98,
    "baseline": 1103,
    "width": 373.33,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "外接 AI：理解要求，提出剪辑安排",
    "x": 98,
    "baseline": 1148,
    "width": 407.83,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "本例由模型操作，未接通自动流程",
    "x": 98,
    "baseline": 1193,
    "width": 400.0,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "工程记录素材、轨道、片段、文字与效果",
    "x": 746,
    "baseline": 1103,
    "width": 504.0,
    "size": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "执行裁切、排列、音画对齐与图层合成",
    "x": 746,
    "baseline": 1148,
    "width": 476.0,
    "size": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "预览与调整围绕同一个工程进行",
    "x": 746,
    "baseline": 1193,
    "width": 392.0,
    "size": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "可预览、可继续修改的编辑工程",
    "x": 1554,
    "baseline": 1103,
    "width": 373.33,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "MP4 / MOV / WebM 视频文件",
    "x": 1554,
    "baseline": 1148,
    "width": 377.42,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "格式与编码受浏览器支持情况约束",
    "x": 1554,
    "baseline": 1193,
    "width": 400.0,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "提出目标 → 编辑 → 预览 → 人或 AI 修改同一工程 → 确认后导出",
    "x": 653.68,
    "baseline": 1341,
    "width": 852.64,
    "size": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "03",
    "x": 72,
    "baseline": 1432,
    "width": 51.81,
    "size": 42
  },
  {
    "text": "底层怎么生成画面与声音？",
    "x": 151,
    "baseline": 1430,
    "width": 456.0,
    "size": 38
  },
  {
    "text": "当前本地导出路径：浏览器内逐帧合成",
    "x": 1680.0,
    "baseline": 1430,
    "width": 408.0,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "01  编辑引擎",
    "x": 96,
    "baseline": 1521,
    "width": 174.88,
    "size": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "Pireel Composition / trim",
    "x": 96,
    "baseline": 1570,
    "width": 306.19,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "管理轨道与时间映射",
    "x": 96,
    "baseline": 1623,
    "width": 228.0,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "例如原片 9–37 秒",
    "x": 96,
    "baseline": 1663,
    "width": 199.91,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "映射到成片 0–28 秒",
    "x": 96,
    "baseline": 1703,
    "width": 225.24,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "02  图文动画",
    "x": 506,
    "baseline": 1521,
    "width": 174.88,
    "size": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "HTML / CSS + GSAP",
    "x": 506,
    "baseline": 1570,
    "width": 242.38,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "排版与计算动画状态",
    "x": 506,
    "baseline": 1623,
    "width": 228.0,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "每个时刻的位置、大小",
    "x": 506,
    "baseline": 1663,
    "width": 253.33,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "透明度与入场效果",
    "x": 506,
    "baseline": 1703,
    "width": 202.67,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "03  画面合成",
    "x": 916,
    "baseline": 1521,
    "width": 174.88,
    "size": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "Canvas / 浏览器绘图",
    "x": 916,
    "baseline": 1570,
    "width": 230.38,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "把视频帧、图片和文字",
    "x": 916,
    "baseline": 1623,
    "width": 253.33,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "叠加为每一帧的画面",
    "x": 916,
    "baseline": 1663,
    "width": 228.0,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "部分转场使用 WebGL",
    "x": 916,
    "baseline": 1703,
    "width": 247.02,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "04  媒体处理",
    "x": 1326,
    "baseline": 1521,
    "width": 174.88,
    "size": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "Mediabunny + WebCodecs",
    "x": 1326,
    "baseline": 1570,
    "width": 325.75,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "读取媒体、调用编解码",
    "x": 1326,
    "baseline": 1623,
    "width": 253.33,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "音频按编辑时间处理",
    "x": 1326,
    "baseline": 1663,
    "width": 228.0,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "把画面和声音封装成文件",
    "x": 1326,
    "baseline": 1703,
    "width": 278.67,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "05  视频文件",
    "x": 1736,
    "baseline": 1521,
    "width": 174.88,
    "size": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "本例：H.264 + AAC",
    "x": 1736,
    "baseline": 1570,
    "width": 227.41,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "28 秒 × 24 帧 / 秒",
    "x": 1736,
    "baseline": 1623,
    "width": 210.03,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "＝ 672 帧画面 + 音频",
    "x": 1736,
    "baseline": 1663,
    "width": 245.35,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "输出可播放的 MP4",
    "x": 1736,
    "baseline": 1703,
    "width": 214.6,
    "size": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "这里的“生成动画”：程序计算并绘制每一帧；不是视频大模型凭描述创造场景与人物。",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 1820,
    "width": 1144.0,
    "size": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "Remotion：另一套程序化视频方案，本次未使用。FFmpeg：用于准备本例输入素材，不是原版导出的主链。",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 1867,
    "width": 1260.96,
    "size": 26
  },
  {
    "text": "WebCodecs 是接口；实际软件或硬件编解码实现由浏览器与设备决定，不能认定总是或完全不使用 FFmpeg。",
    "x": 104,
    "baseline": 1911,
    "width": 1276.9,
    "size": 26
  },
  {
    "text": "04",
    "x": 72,
    "baseline": 2013,
    "width": 51.81,
    "size": 42
  },
  {
    "text": "把原理放进一个真实任务：向同事介绍 Blinko",
    "x": 151,
    "baseline": 2011,
    "width": 777.45,
    "size": 38
  },
  {
    "text": "原版 Studio 已完成剪辑并导出",
    "x": 1760.04,
    "baseline": 2011,
    "width": 327.96,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "剪前 · 45 秒",
    "x": 121.78,
    "baseline": 2099,
    "width": 122.45,
    "size": 22
  },
  {
    "text": "剪后 · 28 秒",
    "x": 601.78,
    "baseline": 2099,
    "width": 122.45,
    "size": 22
  },
  {
    "text": "删掉废话，保留功能与总结，再叠加动态文字。",
    "x": 1002,
    "baseline": 2108,
    "width": 560.0,
    "size": 27
